{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":306010,"duration_api_ms":299746,"num_turns":34,"result":"Now let me produce the required JSON output.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Replaced the hardcoded v2/v3 match in save.rs with a general-purpose migration registry. Migrations are functions over raw serde_json::Value, chained sequentially from MIN_SUPPORTED_SCHEMA (2) to SCHEMA_VERSION (3). A compile-time assert enforces that MIGRATIONS.len() matches the version gap. Added SchemaVersionTooNew and SchemaVersionTooOld error variants to SimError with actionable messages. The existing v2→v3 chemistry-rescale migration was reimplemented on raw JSON to match the registry pattern. Doc comments on the MIGRATIONS array document the full contract for future contributors.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Refactored save.rs: replaced hardcoded match with MIGRATIONS registry (array of MigrationFn), MIN_SUPPORTED_SCHEMA constant, and sequential application loop. Added compile-time assert that MIGRATIONS.len() == SCHEMA_VERSION - MIN_SUPPORTED_SCHEMA.\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added SchemaVersionTooNew and SchemaVersionTooOld variants to SimError in types/actions.rs with human-readable messages (mentions 'upgrade' and 'too old' respectively).\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Reimplemented migrate_v2_to_v3 to operate on raw serde_json::Value instead of deserialized TankState, computing geometry volumes from JSON fields and rescaling all 16 dissolved total fields.\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Documented the migration contract as doc comments on MIGRATIONS: how to add a migration (write fn, append to array, bump version, add test), what migrations can do (rename/add/remove/transform fields), and ordering guarantees.\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added test future_schema_version_produces_clear_error: verifies SchemaVersionTooNew with message content checks for 'newer' and 'upgrade'.\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added test very_old_schema_version_produces_clear_error: verifies SchemaVersionTooOld for schema version 1 (below MIN_SUPPORTED_SCHEMA).\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added test zero_schema_version_produces_clear_error: covers malformed saves with schema_version 0.\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added test migration_chain_applies_v2_to_current: saves at v2, loads through full chain to current schema, verifies concentration preservation and engine construction.\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo test (all 10 save_load tests + full suite pass), cargo clippy -- -D warnings (clean), cargo fmt --check (clean).\",\n      \"order\": 9,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"All 10 save_load tests pass including 4 new ones: future_schema_version_produces_clear_error, very_old_schema_version_produces_clear_error, zero_schema_version_produces_clear_error, migration_chain_applies_v2_to_current\",\n    \"Existing 6 save_load tests continue to pass: roundtrip, source_water_catalog, resume_determinism, active_cycle_state, legacy_v2_migration, legacy_v2_tracker_reseed\",\n    \"Full test suite passes (all crates, all integration tests)\",\n    \"cargo clippy -- -D warnings produces zero warnings\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check passes with no diff\",\n    \"Compile-time const assert guarantees MIGRATIONS array length stays in sync with SCHEMA_VERSION - MIN_SUPPORTED_SCHEMA\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"The original SchemaVersionMismatch error variant is preserved for backward compatibility but is no longer emitted by save.rs; downstream code matching on it should still compile but may need updating if it expects that variant from save loading\",\n    \"The v2→v3 migration was reimplemented on raw JSON rather than using WaterState::rescale_totals_for_volume; the logic is equivalent but any future changes to the rescale method would not automatically propagate to the frozen migration (this is by design — migrations should be immutable once written)\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3edae391-d14e-4673-a468-1445ec19c11a","total_cost_usd":1.5092109999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57334,"cache_read_input_tokens":1487551,"output_tokens":12553,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57334,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":32,"outputTokens":12553,"cacheReadInputTokens":1487551,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57334,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.4160980000000003,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":62,"outputTokens":3943,"cacheReadInputTokens":366560,"cacheCreationInputTokens":29344,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.093113,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"f1859a5c-ff56-4ff0-94f0-a4e6692f29d9"}
